<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman upgrades Danone.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman upgrades Danone.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>French food group Danone SA was raised to a &quot;buy&quot; from &quot;outperform&quot; at Lehman Brothers, a research note by analyst Richard Newboult at the brokerage said on Friday.</p>
<p>The note said Danone expected six percent new profit growth in 1996, which it said was an impressive performance given tough year-on-year comparisons.</p>
<p>Lehman said the outlook for 1997 was good and the recent fall in the shares had created an excellent opportunity to buy.</p>
<p>Danone shares were up one percent at 722 francs at 1042 GMT.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
